{"seq":1,"slug":"personal-controversies","title":"个人争议","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/richard-feynman/controversies-and-appraisal/personal-controversies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"personal-conduct-and-attitudes","title":"个人行为与态度","url":"/c/people/richard-feynman/controversies-and-appraisal/personal-controversies/personal-conduct-and-attitudes","wordCount":1794,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"brashness-and-clashes","title":"锋芒、自信与冲突","url":"/c/people/richard-feynman/controversies-and-appraisal/personal-controversies/brashness-and-clashes","wordCount":1663,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 个人争议\n\n本章审视费曼在个人层面引发的争议。这位魅力四射的科学偶像，其性格与行为也有受到批评的一面，正视这些有助于还原一个真实的费曼。\n\n第一篇文档讨论他在两性关系与个人行为上受到的批评，尤其是以当代视角对其某些态度的反思。第二篇文档讨论他锋芒毕露、自信甚至傲慢的性格，以及由此引发的与同行、机构之间的冲突。\n"}